      "description": "The complete iOS companion for your Mealie server. Browse, create, and edit recipes. Plan meals for the week. Manage shopping lists. All from your mobile device, connected to your own self-hosted instance. Full feature parity with the WebUI!\n\nRECIPES\nSearch and browse your entire recipe library. View ingredients, instructions, nutrition info, and notes. Create new recipes or import them instantly from any URL, image, or web page. Duplicate, share, and organize with tags, categories, and cookbooks.\n\nMEAL PLANNING\nVisual weekly calendar with drag-and-drop. Add recipes to any day, randomize meals based on your rules, and keep your household on the same page.\n\nSHOPPING LISTS\nTick off items as you shop, grouped by label or aisle. Add recipe ingredients to a list in one tap. Changes sync instantly with your server so everyone in the household sees the same list.\n\nBUILT FOR YOUR SERVER\nConnect to one or multiple Mealie instances. Supports self-signed certificates and local network servers out of the box. Your data stays on your hardware. We never see it.\n\nMORE\n- Cookbooks and organizers\n- Household and group management\n- Widgets for recipes, meal plans, and shopping\n- Full iPad support with multi-column navigation\n- Keyboard shortcuts and drag-and-drop\n- Admin tools for server maintenance and backups",
